I just 'ginned up a samauri, Rnd00076 early in a
long and inglorious line of randomly selected cannon
fodder, and taking a quick look at #enhance before I
take a move got me to wondering. The samauri starts
with long sword and short sword at basic, and with
#twoweapon at unskilled. If I start #twoweapon-ing
immediately, as I understand it, every successful
hit with my primary weapon is also a hit with my
secondary weapon automatically.

So, here's two questions.

1) Does this one hit exercise all three skills, long
   sword, short sword, and #twoweapon-ing, some two
   skills, or just the #twoweapon skill?

2) Does the correct answer, whichever one it is,
